<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY JAN PPI UP 4.7 PCT MTH/MTH VS DEC 1.0 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY JAN PPI UP 4.7 PCT MTH/MTH VS DEC 1.0 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's producer price</p>
<p>index (PPI) was 4.7 percent up month-on-month in January,</p>
<p>compared with 1.0 percent in December, while the PPI showed</p>
<p>22.2 year-on year rise in January, the Central Statistical</p>
<p>Office said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p> 8  PRODUCER PRICES	   Jan 97    Dec 96    Jan 96</p>
<p> Monhtly change (pct)	   +4.7     +1.0	 +2.3</p>
<p> Year-on-year change (pct)   +22.2    +20.1	+26.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The KSH said that domestic sales prices rose 6.2</p>
<p>percent month-on-month and 24.4 percent year-on-year. Export</p>
<p>prices, calculated in forints, rose 1.8 percent in January from</p>
<p>December and were 17.9 percent higher year-on-year.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
